  "description": "Decision 342 tau-side development probe (phase1.25_pilot-wand item 2.7), exploratory: 32 open faceted prism sectors with a longitudinal UV seam; tau-side hinges cycle 8, 12, 9.9 and 10.25 degrees across the 0.985 normal gate, both signs, diagonals and 0.1875/0.3125 texel facet depths; 40 narrow far-chart controls sweep total tau/far angle 8/9.9/10/10.25/12 degrees, both signs, and seam-triangle depth 0.0625/0.125/0.1875/0.3125 texel, with one far tap at seam endpoints. Disjoint copies, fixed mesh box [-256,256] x [-64,64] x [-256,256] cm; document resolution 512. User0-User7 added as RGB32F (a record whose template capture shows one of them not 32F is void); one fill with the eight channels active, Normal at opacity 1, default projection (read back), sources the authored float32 kernel code at the document size: User0-User2 one-hot the nine classes x mod 3 + 3 (y mod 3) of the texel (column x, row y from the top), User3 the UV ramp R = (x + 0.5)/N, G = (y + 0.5)/N, B = 0.5, User4 and User5 the periodic codes d and e (k/256, one 17 x 13 texel tile each), User6 (d + e)/2 and User7 1 - d. The eight maps at OpenEXR 32f with infinite padding and with passthrough (every covered texel must equal its source bit for bit, or the probe is void), every export step done twice in the session.",
